{"seq":2,"slug":"cross-encoder-reranking","title":"交叉编码器重排序","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-search-retrieval/ranking-models/cross-encoder-reranking","wordCount":940,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"交叉编码器重排序\">交叉编码器重排序</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>交叉编码器重排序（Cross-Encoder Reranking）是在初始检索阶段之后，使用高精度的交叉编码器模型对候选文档进行精细排序的技术。Cross-Encoder 将查询和文档联合编码，通过 Transformer 的全注意力机制捕获查询-文档之间的深层语义交互，排序质量远超 Bi-Encoder。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    Q[查询] --&gt; RETRIEVER[初始检索器]&#10;    RETRIEVER --&gt; TOP_K[Top-K 候选]&#10;    TOP_K --&gt; CE[Cross-Encoder]&#10;    CE --&gt; RERANKED[重排序结果]&#10;    subgraph 初始检索&#10;        RETRIEVER --&gt; BM25_R[BM25]&#10;        RETRIEVER --&gt; DENSE_R[稠密检索]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 重排序&#10;        CE --&gt; PAIR[逐对评分]&#10;        PAIR --&gt; SORT[分数排序]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    Q[查询] --&gt; RETRIEVER[初始检索器]\n    RETRIEVER --&gt; TOP_K[Top-K 候选]\n    TOP_K --&gt; CE[Cross-Encoder]\n    CE --&gt; RERANKED[重排序结果]\n    subgraph 初始检索\n        RETRIEVER --&gt; BM25_R[BM25]\n        RETRIEVER --&gt; DENSE_R[稠密检索]\n    end\n    subgraph 重排序\n        CE --&gt; PAIR[逐对评分]\n        PAIR --&gt; SORT[分数排序]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>Bi-Encoder</th>\n<th>Cross-Encoder</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>编码方式</td>\n<td>查询/文档独立编码</td>\n<td>查询-文档联合编码</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>注意力交互</td>\n<td>无（编码后点积）</td>\n<td>全交互（自注意力）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>文档预计算</td>\n<td>支持（离线编码）</td>\n<td>不支持（依赖查询）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>推理复杂度</td>\n<td>O(1) 每文档</td>\n<td>O(n+m) 每对</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>匹配质量</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用规模</td>\n<td>百万-十亿级</td>\n<td>百-千级</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"cross-encoder-架构与训练\">Cross-Encoder 架构与训练</h2><p>Cross-Encoder 的训练通常采用二元分类或回归框架。给定查询-文档对 (q, d)，模型输出一个相关性分数。训练数据可以来自人工标注（如 MS MARCO 的稀疏标注）或搜索日志（点击/未点击）。其联合编码所建模的匹配原理，以及与 Bi-Encoder、ColBERT 延迟交互的谱系对比，在<a href=\"../query-understanding/semantic-matching\">语义匹配</a>中有更基础的讨论。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface CrossEncoderTrainingConfig {&#10;  baseModel: string;&#10;  maxLength: number;&#10;  learningRate: number;&#10;  batchSize: number;&#10;  warmupSteps: number;&#10;  epochs: number;&#10;  lossType: &#39;bce&#39; | &#39;mse&#39; | &#39;margin_mse&#39;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface TrainingSample {&#10;  query: string;&#10;  document: string;&#10;  label: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface MarginMSEBatch {&#10;  query: string;&#10;  docPos: string;&#10;  docNeg: string;&#10;  teacherPosScore: number;&#10;  teacherNegScore: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function marginMSELoss(&#10;  studentPosScore: number,&#10;  studentNegScore: number,&#10;  teacherPosScore: number,&#10;  teacherNegScore: number,&#10;): number {&#10;  const studentMargin = studentPosScore - studentNegScore;&#10;  const teacherMargin = teacherPosScore - teacherNegScore;&#10;  return (studentMargin - teacherMargin) ** 2;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface RerankPipeline {&#10;  retriever: Retriever;&#10;  reranker: CrossEncoder;&#10;  retrieveTopK: number;&#10;  rerankTopK: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;async function rerankPipeline(&#10;  query: string,&#10;  pipeline: RerankPipeline,&#10;): Promise&lt;Array&lt;{ docId: string; score: number }&gt;&gt; {&#10;  const candidates = await pipeline.retriever.search(query, pipeline.retrieveTopK);&#10;&#10;  const pairs = candidates.map((c) =&gt; ({&#10;    query,&#10;    document: c.content,&#10;    docId: c.id,&#10;  }));&#10;&#10;  const scores = await pipeline.reranker.scoreBatch(pairs.map((p) =&gt; [p.query, p.document]));&#10;&#10;  return pairs&#10;    .map((p, i) =&gt; ({ docId: p.docId, score: scores[i] }))&#10;    .sort((a, b) =&gt; b.score - a.score)&#10;    .slice(0, pipeline.rerankTopK);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CrossEncoderTrainingConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  baseModel</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  maxLength</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  learningRate</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  batchSize</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  warmupSteps</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  epochs</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  lossType</span><span 