/span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [p.query, p.document]));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pairs</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">i</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ({ docId: p.docId, score: scores[i] }))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sort</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b.score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a.score)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">slice</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, pipeline.rerankTopK);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>MonoT5 是一种基于生成模型的重排序方法，它将相关性判断建模为 &quot;true&quot;/&quot;false&quot; 的文本生成任务。RankGPT 则利用 LLM 的推理能力直接对候选文档列表进行排序。</p>\n<h2 id=\"多阶段级联重排序\">多阶段级联重排序</h2><p>在大规模搜索系统中，单一的 Cross-Encoder 重排序往往不够。需要设计多阶段级联排序架构，每一阶段使用更复杂的模型处理更少的候选文档，逐级精炼排序结果。完整的漏斗设计——召回、粗排、精排、策略层各自的候选配额与延迟预算——在<a href=\"multi-stage-ranking\">多阶段排序</a>中系统展开。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    CORPUS[全量文档库] --&gt; L0[L0: 倒排索引/ANN]&#10;    L0 --&gt;|Top 1000| L1[L1: 轻量级重排]&#10;    L1 --&gt;|Top 100| L2[L2: Cross-Encoder]&#10;    L2 --&gt;|Top 10| L3[L3: LLM 精排]&#10;    L3 --&gt; RESULT[最终展示]&#10;    subgraph 级联排序&#10;        L0&#10;        L1&#10;        L2&#10;        L3&#10;    end\">graph TB\n    CORPUS[全量文档库] --&gt; L0[L0: 倒排索引/ANN]\n    L0 --&gt;|Top 1000| L1[L1: 轻量级重排]\n    L1 --&gt;|Top 100| L2[L2: Cross-Encoder]\n    L2 --&gt;|Top 10| L3[L3: LLM 精排]\n    L3 --&gt; RESULT[最终展示]\n    subgraph 级联排序\n        L0\n        L1\n        L2\n        L3\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>模型复杂度</th>\n<th>候选量</th>\n<th>延迟预算</th>\n<th>典型模型</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>L0 召回</td>\n<td>最低</td>\n<td>百万-十亿 → 1000</td>\n<td>10-50ms</td>\n<td>BM25 / Bi-Encoder</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L1 粗排</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>1000 → 100</td>\n<td>10-20ms</td>\n<td>轻量 MLP / 小 BERT</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L2 精排</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>100 → 10-20</td>\n<td>50-100ms</td>\n<td>Cross-Encoder</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L3 重排</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>10-20 → 最终</td>\n<td>100-500ms</td>\n<td>LLM / 多模态</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>每个阶段的设计需要考虑两个核心指标：上一阶段的召回率（确保相关文档不被过早淘汰）和本阶段的排序精度（在允许的延迟内尽可能提升排序质量）。</p>\n<p>阶段之间的文档截断数量（Top-K 设置）需要仔细调优。过大的 K 值增加下游计算成本，过小的 K 值可能丢失相关文档。理想的策略是通过离线评估确定每个阶段的最小 K 值，使得目标文档的漏失率低于某个阈值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"在线推理优化\">在线推理优化</h2><p>Cross-Encoder 的在线推理是重排序系统的性能瓶颈。针对这一问题，有多种优化策略。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface InferenceOptimization {&#10;  batchSize: number;&#10;  maxSeqLength: number;&#10;  quantization: &#39;fp32&#39; | &#39;fp16&#39; | &#39;int8&#39; | &#39;int4&#39;;&#10;  pruning: boolean;&#10;  caching: boolean;&#10;  earlyExit: boolean;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface CacheConfig {&#10;  maxSize: number;&#10;  ttlSeconds: number;&#10;  keyStrategy: &#39;query_doc_hash&#39; | &#39;query_hash&#39;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function queryDocHash(query: string, docId: string): string {&#10;  return `${hashFnv1a(query)}_${docId}`;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface EarlyExitConfig {&#10;  confidenceThreshold: number;&#10;  minLayers: number;&#10;  maxLayers: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function shouldEarlyExit(layerOutput: Float32Array, config: EarlyExitConfig, currentLayer: number): boolean {&#10;  if (currentLayer &lt; config.minLayers) return false;&#10;  const confidence = Math.abs(sigmoid(layerOutput[0]) - 0.5) * 2;&#10;  return confidence &gt;= config.confidenceThreshold;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface DynamicBatchConfig {&#10;  maxBatchSize: number;&#10;  maxWaitMs: number;&#10;  padToMultipleOf: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;async function dynamicBatch(&#10;  requests: Array&lt;{ query: string; document: string }&gt;,&#10;  config: DynamicBatchConfig,&#10;): Promise&lt;number[]&gt; {&#10;  const sorted = [...requests].sort(&#10;    (a, b) =&gt; a.query.length + a.document.length - (b.query.length + b.document.length),&#10;  );&#10;&#10;  const padded = sorted.map((r) =&gt; {&#10;    const totalLen = r.query.length + r.document.length;&#10;    const paddedLen = Math.ceil(totalLen / config.padToMultipleOf) * config.padToMultipleOf;&#10;    return { ...r, paddedLen };&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  return forwardBatch(padded);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> InferenceOptimization</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  batchSize</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  maxSeqLength</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  quantization</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'fp32'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'fp16'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'int8'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'int4'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  pruning</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  caching</span><span style=