style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> paddedLen</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ceil</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(totalLen </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> config.padToMultipleOf) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> config.padToMultipleOf;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">r, paddedLen };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> forwardBatch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(padded);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>关键优化手段包括：INT8/INT4 量化降低计算量和内存带宽需求；动态批处理将多个请求合并为一个 GPU batch；早退机制（Early Exit）在模型中间层就输出高置信度的结果；结果缓存避免重复计算热门查询。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Cross-Encoder 通过查询-文档联合编码实现最高质量的语义匹配，是重排序的核心模型</li>\n<li>多阶段级联排序（召回 → 粗排 → 精排 → 重排）是大规模搜索系统的标准架构</li>\n<li>MarginMSE 是训练 Cross-Encoder 的有效损失函数，利用教师模型的分数差作为监督信号</li>\n<li>在线推理优化（量化、动态批处理、早退、缓存）是 Cross-Encoder 落地的关键工程技术</li>\n<li>MonoT5 和 RankGPT 代表了基于生成模型重排序的新方向，利用 LLM 的推理能力提升排序质量</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"交叉编码器重排序","id":"交叉编码器重排序"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Cross-Encoder 架构与训练","id":"cross-encoder-架构与训练"},{"level":2,"text":"多阶段级联重排序","id":"多阶段级联重排序"},{"level":2,"text":"在线推理优化","id":"在线推理优化"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"学习排序","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-search-retrieval/ranking-models/learning-to-rank"},"next":{"title":"多阶段排序","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-search-retrieval/ranking-models/multi-stage-ranking"}}